msgstr "加载应用程序时发生错误。"

#: src/ui/bootstrap/connect-database/connect-database.tsx
msgid "It looks like you installed an older version of CS2Lighter and the current database schema is not compatible with it."
msgstr "当前安装的 CS2Lighter 版本较旧，与现有数据库结构不兼容。"

#: src/ui/bootstrap/connect-database/connect-database.tsx
msgid "You can either update CS2Lighter to the latest version or reset the database to start from scratch."
msgstr "可以将 CS2Lighter 更新到最新版本，或重置数据库以重新开始。"

#: src/ui/bootstrap/connect-database/connect-database.tsx
msgid "The embedded PostgreSQL server could not be started, see the application log file and the PostgreSQL log file in <0>{folderPath}</0> for details."
msgstr "无法启动内置 PostgreSQL 服务器，请查看应用日志和 <0>{folderPath}</0> 中的 PostgreSQL 日志了解详情。"

