msgstr "现有数据由另一个 PostgreSQL 版本创建，当前 CS2Lighter 内置的版本无法读取。"

#: src/ui/bootstrap/connect-database/connect-database.tsx
msgid "Keep a backup of your database folder before migrating to another PostgreSQL version. Deleting data starts a new empty library."
msgstr "迁移到其他 PostgreSQL 版本前，请备份数据库文件夹。删除数据后将创建一个空资料库。"

#: src/ui/bootstrap/connect-database/connect-database.tsx
msgid "The PostgreSQL binaries bundled with CS2Lighter are missing, reinstall the application or use an external server."
msgstr "CS2Lighter 内置的 PostgreSQL 程序文件缺失，请重新安装应用或使用外部数据库服务器。"

#: src/ui/bootstrap/connect-database/connect-database.tsx
msgid "This error usually means that the database is not running or that the connection settings are incorrect."
msgstr "这个错误通常意味着数据库未运行或者连接设置不正确"

