msgid "The model did not respond in time. Try again or choose a faster model."
msgstr "模型响应超时，请重试或选择响应更快的模型。"

#: src/ui/habits/use-ai-error-message.ts
msgid "The AI service returned an incomplete or unsupported response. No report was saved."
msgstr "AI 服务返回了未完成或暂不支持的响应，本次点评未保存。"

