msgid "The model reached its output limit before completing the report. No report was saved. The request allows up to 24,000 tokens; check whether your service applies a lower limit."
msgstr "模型达到输出上限，点评尚未完成，因此没有保存。解析器已允许最多 24,000 tokens，请检查 AI 服务是否另有限制。"

